     </div>
    </div>
   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude>&#160;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b></b></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-07-01_2026-03-31" name="us-gaap:FinanceLoansAndLeasesReceivablePolicy" id="c145831967" escape="true"><p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Notes Receivable</b></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">On <em style="font: inherit;"> March 17, 2026, </em>PC Group, Inc. ("<i>Lender</i>")&#160;a subsidiary of the Company, entered into an Amended and Restated Senior Unsecured Promissory Note (the "<i>Note</i>") with SPAR Marketing Force, Inc. (the "<i>Borrower</i>"), pursuant to which the Borrower <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>obtain financing of up to $<ix:nonFraction id="c145830219" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="trak:DebtInstrumentMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-6">4.0</ix:nonFraction> million.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><i>Note&#160;Consideration</i></span></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Maximum Principal:</b>&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c145830220" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="trak:DebtInstrumentMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">4,000,000</ix:nonFraction></p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Amount Funded:</b>&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c145830221" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">3,000,000</ix:nonFraction> as of the reporting date</p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Additional Availability:</b>&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c145830222" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="trak:DebtInstrumentDelayedDrawCapacity" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction> delayed draw beginning <em style="font: inherit;"> July 17, 2026</em></p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Interest Rate:</b>&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c145830223" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">8.0</ix:nonFraction>% per annum</p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Default Rate:</b>&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c145830224" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="Pure" name="trak:DebtInstrumentDefaultRate" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">12.0</ix:nonFraction>% per annum</p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Payment Terms:</b>&#160;Monthly interest-only</p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Maturity Date:</b>&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-03-17_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate" id="c145830225" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en">March 16, 2029</ix:nonNumeric></em></p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Security:</b>&#160;Unsecured</p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><i>Equity Consideration</i></span></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">In connection with the Note, the Borrower agreed to cause its parent, SPAR Group, Inc., to issue <ix:nonFraction id="c145830226" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="Share" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationSharesToBeIssued" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock (NASDAQ: SGRP) to the Company at a stated value of $<ix:nonFraction id="c145830227" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationSharesToBeIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.80</ix:nonFraction> per share, within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-03-17_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationPeriodOfIssuance" id="c145830228" format="ixt-sec:durday">30</ix:nonNumeric> days of the execution of the Note. As of the reporting date, the shares have <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> yet been issued. If the equity consideration is <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> issued as required under the Note, the Company <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>have rights under the agreement, including potential remedies for non-performance.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 36pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 27pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><i>Accounting for Equity Consideration</i></span></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt;">The Company expects that the equity consideration will be accounted for as an additional component of the overall return on the loan receivable. The Company will evaluate whether the equity represents a discount or other yield enhancement in accordance with ASC <em style="font: inherit;">835</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">30</em> and ASC <em style="font: inherit;">310</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">20,</em> and will recognize such amount over the term of the Note using the effective interest method.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt;">As the shares have <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> yet been issued, <em style="font: inherit;">no</em> amount has been recognized related to the equity consideration as of the reporting date.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -9pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><i>Price Protection Provisions</i></span></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt; text-align: justify;">The Note includes price protection provisions that <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>require the Borrower to make cash payments to the Company if:</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Equity is issued below $<ix:nonFraction id="c145830237" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationSharesToBeIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.80</ix:nonFraction> per share, or</p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:34pt;">&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:18pt;"> <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The market price of SPAR Group, Inc. common stock is below $<ix:nonFraction id="c145830238" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="trak:DebtInstrumentEquityConsiderationSharesToBeIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.80</ix:nonFraction> per share at specified dates</p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">Aggregate payments are capped at $<ix:nonFraction id="c145830239" contextRef="i_2026-03-17_DebtInstrumentAxis-TheNoteMember_LegalEntityAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis-PCGroupIncMember_LongtermDebtTypeAxis-UnsecuredDebtMember" unitRef="USD" name="trak:DebtInstrumentMaximumAggregatePayments" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">800,000</ix:nonFraction>.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><i>Embedded Feature Evaluation</i></span></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">The Company has evaluated the price protection provisions and preliminarily concluded that such features are <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> clearly and closely related to the host loan receivable and therefore <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>require bifurcation as a derivative instrument under ASC <em style="font: inherit;">815.</em> This conclusion is based on the fact that the provisions introduce variability in cash flows based on the equity pricing of SPAR Group, Inc., a <em style="font: inherit;">third</em>-party issuer, which is <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> clearly and closely related to a lending arrangement. The final determination is pending completion of the Company&#8217;s valuation analysis, which is dependent in part on the issuance and measurement of the related equity consideration.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 36pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Credit Risk and Consideration</span></i></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;">The loan is unsecured and represents a concentration of credit risk with a single borrower. The Company&#8217;s ability to collect principal, interest, and any contingent consideration is dependent on the financial condition and operating performance of the Borrower. The Company monitors the Borrower&#8217;s financial condition on an ongoing basis; however, <em style="font: inherit;">no</em> collateral or other credit enhancements have been obtained to mitigate this risk.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-indent: 27pt;"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Company Carrying Value</span></i></p>
   <p style="text-indent: 9pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;width:61%;margin-left:0pt;margin-right:auto;"><tbody><tr><td style="vertical-align:middle;width:auto;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>(in thousands)</b></p> </td><td style="vertical-align:middle;width:auto;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Amount</b></p> </td></tr>
<tr><td style="vertical-align:middle;width:auto;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Note receivable</p> </td><td style="vertical-align:middle;width:auto;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">$<ix:nonFraction id="c145830245" contextRef="i_2026-03-31_CounterpartyNameAxis-SparMarketingForceIncMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:NotesAndLoansReceivableNetNoncurrent" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-6">3,000</ix:nonFraction></p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
