  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">General and administrative expense was $1,376,346&#160;and $1,455,602&#160;for the three months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, respectively, a&#160;5% decrease.&#160;The decrease in general and administrative expense was due to reduction of administrative headcount and associated costs, timing of renewal fees, lower stock compensation costs, and lower lease costs.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
