  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Net other income was $184,415&#160;for the three months ended March 31, 2026, compared to net other income of $306,866&#160;for the three months ended March 31, 2025.&#160;Other income decreased due to unrealized losses on certain investments offset by an&#160;increase in interest income attributable to earnings&#160;on fixed income instruments as a result in higher cash balances.&#160;In September 2024, the Federal Reserve began cutting interest rates, which reductions make it unlikely the Company will be able to maintain the same interest income on its existing cash balances without taking additional credit risk or increasing the total amount of cash held for investment.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
