  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><i>Comparison of the Nine&#160;Months Ended&#160;March 31, 2026 to the Nine&#160;Months Ended March 31, 2025.</i></b></p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><i>Revenue</i></b></p>
