  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">General and administrative expense was $4,216,435&#160;and $4,124,706&#160;for the nine&#160;months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, respectively, a 2% increase.&#160;The increase in general and administrative expense was primarily due to higher employee benefit costs, general liability insurance, increases in D&amp;O insurance due to a higher market cap, and higher payroll taxes due to an increase in commissions and other benefit programs.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
