  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Depreciation and amortization expense was $563,090&#160;and $913,646&#160;for the nine&#160;months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, respectively, a decrease&#160;of 38%.&#160;The decrease was due to certain leased assets obtained with financing arrangements becoming fully amortized.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
